  <li>
    <h2>Comprehensive Promotion and Service for Issuers</h2>
    <div class="slide">
      <div class="container">
          <div class="area">
          <p style="text-align: justify;">The main purpose of the area is to maintain direct contact with the issuers listed in the Mexican Stock Exchange, providing customized attention in order to support their development, rendering efficient and competitive services focused on timely fulfillment of the obligations stipulated by the legislation in force, for which purpose we have the following structure in the area:</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Promotion of Issuers</strong>, to support them in everything related to financing, new products and events. (A presentation will be published with updated financing data at BMV).</p>
<p style="text-align: justify;"><strong>Comprehensive Service to Issuers</strong>, within a schedule from 7:00 a.m. to 7:00 p.m. during working days at email <a href="mailto:emisoras@grupobmv.com.mx?subject=Assistance%20need%20from%20Issuer">emisoras@grupobmv.com.mx</a>&nbsp;and at phone number 5342-9123, through the following services:</p>
<ul>
    <li style="text-align: justify;">Advice and training on the use of EMISNET, BMV&rsquo;s page, obligations for delivery of information, legislation in force and market trading. If your issuer is interested in this training, do not hesitate to contact us.</li>
    <li style="text-align: justify;">Follow-up of information delivery obligations, ensuring timely and proper compliance.</li>
    <li style="text-align: justify;">Authentication of EMISNET users.</li>
    <li style="text-align: justify;">News bulletin and dissemination of useful communications to issuers.</li>
</ul>

          </div><!--End area-->
          
        <ul class="list-downloads">
            
        </ul><!-- list-downloads -->
          
      </div><!-- container -->
    </div><!-- slide -->
  </li>

    
    
    
